B.a26=new A.am(B.a3u,["5 Planl\u0131 B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7","35 - 45 Dakika (Tek Haritada)","9 - 11 Saat (5 G\xf6\xe7 \u0130le)","100+ Tamga ile 11.0x H\u0131z"],t.w)
B.XW=s(["Karo fetih maliyeti 10.000 g\u0131day\u0131 a\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda \xfcretimin yava\u015flamas\u0131n\u0131 beklemeyin.","Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131 seviyenizin 5, 10, 20, 30 ve 40 basamaklar\u0131na ula\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 do\u011frulay\u0131n.","B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7 ba\u015flat\u0131p kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z Tamgalarla bir sonraki ko\u015fuyu 2-3 kat daha h\u0131zl\u0131 tamamlay\u0131n."],t.s)
B.VH=s(["Do not wait for production to grind to a halt when conquest costs exceed 10,000 food.","Check that your Castle has reached milestones 5, 10, 20, 30, or 40.","Trigger Great Migration to accelerate your next run by 2-3x."],t.s)
B.UG=s(["1. G\xf6\xe7ten sonra ilk 5 seviyeyi ge\xe7mek sadece 2-3 dakikan\u0131z\u0131 alacakt\u0131r; s\u0131f\u0131rlanmaktan asla korkmay\u0131n.","G\xf6\xe7 etmeden \xf6nce ambar\u0131n\u0131zdaki kaynaklar\u0131 harcamay\u0131n; ambar refah\u0131 size +1 ila +4 ekstra Ta\xe7 kazand\u0131r\u0131r."],t.s)
B.UW=s(["Reaching Level 5 after your 1st migration takes only 2-3 minutes; never fear resetting.","Do not spend stockpile resources right before migrating; high stores grant +1 to +4 extra Crowns."],t.s)
B.Yk=s(["zamanlama","e\u015fik","strateji","plan","h\u0131z","g\xf6\xe7","timing","threshold","guide"],t.s)
B.QU=new A.bt("migration_optimal_timing",B.lt,"B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7 Stratejik Zamanlamas\u0131 & 5 Alt\u0131n E\u015fik","Strategic Migration Timing & 5 Golden Thresholds","T\xfcm \xe7a\u011flar\u0131 ve Kozmik Zirveyi 9-11 saatte tamamlaman\u0131z\u0131 sa\u011flayan matematiksel optimal g\xf6\xe7 takvimi.","Mathematical optimal prestige schedule to clear all ages and technologies within 9-11 hours.","Bozk\u0131r sim\xfclasyonlar\u0131, k\xf6r\xfc k\xf6r\xfcne tek haritada kalman\u0131n oyunu 50+ saat uzatt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131; do\u011fru zamanlanm\u0131\u015f 5 Alt\u0131n E\u015fik (5 B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7) ile ise t\xfcm oyunun 9-11 saatte tamamlanabildi\u011fini kan\u0131tlam\u0131\u015ft\u0131r:\n\n1. E\u015e\u0130K: \u0130lk S\u0131\xe7rama (20-25. Dakika)\n\u2022 \u015eart: \u015eato Sv. 5-6 | 12-14 Karo\n\u2022 Kazan\xe7: +6-7 Tamga, +4-5 Ta\xe7 (Kut: 1.25x)\n\u2022 Hedef: \u0130lk T\xf6re fermanlar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7mak ve \xfcretimi %25 h\u0131zland\u0131rmak.\n\n2. E\u015e\u0130K: Erken Zanaat & Kervan (1. Saat - 1s 15dk)\n\u2022 \u015eart: \u015eato Sv. 10-12 | 18-20 Karo\n\u2022 Kazan\xe7: +14-16 Tamga, +8-10 Ta\xe7 (K\xfcm\xfclatif: ~22 Tamga, 1.9x Kut)\n\u2022 Hedef: Meyve Bah\xe7esi ve Kervan doktrinlerini kal\u0131c\u0131 k\u0131lmak.\n\n3. E\u015e\u0130K: Demir & A\u011f\u0131r Sanayi (2.5 - 3. Saat)\n\u2022 \u015eart: \u015eato Sv. 20 | 25-28 Karo | Madenler & F\u0131r\u0131nlar aktif\n\u2022 Kazan\xe7: +20-25 Tamga, +18-20 Ta\xe7 (K\xfcm\xfclatif: ~45 Tamga, 2.8x Kut)\n\u2022 Hedef: 25. karonun \xfcssel duvar\u0131ndan kurtulup madenleri katlamak.\n\n4. E\u015e\u0130K: Bozk\u0131r \u0130mparatorlu\u011fu (5. - 6. Saat)\n\u2022 \u015eart: \u015eato Sv. 30-35 | 35-42 Karo | K\u0131m\u0131z Yurtlar\u0131 & Ke\xe7e \xc7ad\u0131rlar\u0131\n\u2022 Kazan\xe7: +35-45 Tamga, +35-40 Ta\xe7 (K\xfcm\xfclatif: ~85 Tamga, 5.0x Kut)\n\u2022 Hedef: Efsanevi biyomlar\u0131 tek vuru\u015fta fethetmek.\n\n5. E\u015e\u0130K: Kozmik Zirveye H\xfccum (8. - 9. Saat)\n\u2022 \u015eart: \u015eato Sv. 40+ | 50+ Karo | \u015eam \xc7eli\u011fi d\xf6k\xfcmhaneleri\n\u2022 Kazan\xe7: 100+ Tamga baraj\u0131n\u0131 a\u015farak 11.0x MEGA KUT PATLAMASINI tetiklemek.\n\u2022 Sonu\xe7: Son ko\u015fuda \u015eato 50 Kozmik Zirve yap\u0131lar\u0131 1-2 saatte tamamlan\u0131r.","Progression simulations prove that lingering on one map extends playtime beyond 50+ hours, while 5 structured migrations clear the entire game in 9-11 hours:\n\n1. Threshold (20-25 min): Castle Lvl 5-6, 12-14 hexes -> +6 Tamga (1.25x Kut).\n2. Threshold (1h 15m): Castle Lvl 10-12, 18-20 hexes -> +15 Tamga (1.9x Kut).\n3. Threshold (2.5-3h): Castle Lvl 20, 25-28 hexes -> +25 Tamga (2.8x Kut).\n4. Threshold (5-6h): Castle Lvl 30-35, 35-42 hexes -> +40 Tamga (5.0x Kut).\n5. Threshold (8-9h): Castle Lvl 40+, 50+ hexes -> Surpass 100 Tamgas to trigger the 11.0x MEGA KUT MULTIPLIER.",B.Sy,B.t,"TAKT\u0130K REHBER",B.a26,B.XW,B.VH,B.UG,B.UW,B.Yk)
